{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Playtime</strong> <br>Approximately 1.5 to 3 hours</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gameplay</strong> <br>You step into an abandoned military base. <br>There, you will face unspeakable horrors\u2026 <br>and your only goal is to survive and escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Background</strong> <br>The story begins when a curious child enters a restricted military zone. <br>Inside, they experience terrifying events that defy explanation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Developer\u2019s Note</strong> <br><i>Frontier Outpost</i> is the very first horror game created by a solo developer who learned Unreal Engine through self-study. <br>The game may have many shortcomings, but this project represents my passion for learning and my determination to grow. <br>I want to continue making horror games and improve step by step. <br>If you share the same dream, feel free to reach out \u2014 I\u2019m looking for people to join me on this journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Distribution &amp; Streaming Guidelines</strong> <br>When streaming or uploading gameplay videos, please include the game\u2019s title or a Steam link in the stream title or video description. <br>This small gesture means a lot to a solo developer. <br>The developer is not responsible for any damages or losses caused by the distribution of videos of this game.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4052170?t=1761291370","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4052170?t=1761291370","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4052170/e990a94d7c065dd91cfd8cb31cb4118a650a5a00/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761291370","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4052170/e990a94d7c065dd91cfd8cb31cb4118a650a5a00/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761291370","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"This game contains scenes of fear, blood, and psychological horror.\r\nSome scenes may be disturbing to sensitive players.\r\nThere is no sexual content, drug use, or self-harm depicted."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Playtime</strong> <br>Approximately 1.5 to 3 hours</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gameplay</strong> <br>You step into an abandoned military base. <br>There, you will face unspeakable horrors\u2026 <br>and your only goal is to survive and escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Background</strong> <br>The story begins when a curious child enters a restricted military zone. <br>Inside, they experience terrifying events that defy explanation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Developer\u2019s Note</strong> <br><i>Frontier Outpost</i> is the very first horror game created by a solo developer who learned Unreal Engine through self-study. <br>The game may have many shortcomings, but this project represents my passion for learning and my determination to grow. <br>I want to continue making horror games and improve step by step. <br>If you share the same dream, feel free to reach out \u2014 I\u2019m looking for people to join me on this journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Distribution &amp; Streaming Guidelines</strong> <br>When streaming or uploading gameplay videos, please include the game\u2019s title or a Steam link in the stream title or video description. <br>This small gesture means a lot to a solo developer. <br>The developer is not responsible for any damages or losses caused by the distribution of videos of this game.</p>","developers":["LEESUKHYUNG"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/ap